{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable"},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Keys and storage","level":3,"anchor":"Keys-and-storage","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode before each presentation. Add ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Info.plist.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":": complete data protection, out of backups.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":" is for tests.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","isActive":true},{"text":" at launch, before any issuance,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Make one ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":" per key store and credential store, and share it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authorization server revokes the grant.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","isActive":true},{"text":" as false and can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"The Wallet Provider","level":3,"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"development only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Trust","level":3,"anchor":"Trust","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for credentials, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","isActive":true},{"text":" for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register themselves.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For readers, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","isActive":true},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"text":" where every reader","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must be a known one.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never ship with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","isActive":true},{"text":" set.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins","isActive":true},{"text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requests, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPinnedDomains"},{"text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"text":" yourself.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Privacy","level":3,"anchor":"Privacy","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Request batches of copies (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"text":") and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refresh them as they’re used up (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so presentations stay unlinkable; warn the holder when one wouldn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Log ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","isActive":true},{"text":", never claims or credentials.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"The build","level":3,"anchor":"The-build","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ship the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the package links by default.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Refuse to run on the test build, which carries an in-process issuer and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifier: check ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild"},{"text":" at launch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"A document provider extension","level":3,"anchor":"A-document-provider-extension","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app and its extension each update a credential’s record — marking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a copy presented, replacing copies on refresh — with a lock that spans","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only their own process. Refresh credentials when the app becomes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"active, not while it’s in the background, so the two don’t write the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same record at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"title":"Essentials"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Going to production","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","title":"OID4VCWallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","abstract":[{"text":"NewWallet’s configuration.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/holderKeyPresent":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderKeyPresent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"holderKeyPresent","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the key store still holds the credential’s key: without it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(restored to another device, say) it can’t be presented. Set in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet.credentials()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet.credential(id:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/holderkeypresent"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","title":"WalletProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/development":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/development","title":"development","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"development","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Relaxes what production requires, for a wallet talking to services","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on a development machine. Never ship an app with it set. It lets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuers, Authorization Servers, Verifiers and status lists be on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses, over http there too, and skips the production","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"checks on receiving credentials: durable stores and keys, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"random source.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/verifierRoots":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/verifierroots","title":"verifierRoots","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifierRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"PEM certificates: the trust anchors for Verifiers’ requests. A request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signed by a certificate that doesn’t chain to them is refused unread.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/sweeporphanedkeys(in:)","title":"sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sweepOrphanedKeys","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16KeychainKeyStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Deletes every key in ","type":"text"},{"code":"keyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that none of the wallet’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials is bound to — left by an issuance the app quit or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"crashed in the middle of — and returns how many. Call it at launch,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before any issuance or refresh: one in progress holds keys of its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRequireEKU":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocReaderRequireEKU","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"mdocReaderRequireEKU","abstract":[{"text":"Recognizes only reader certificates with the ISO\/IEC 18013-5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader authentication extended key usage (1.0.18013.5.1.6), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate issued for another role under ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t taken for a reader’s.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderrequireeku"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","title":"Handling errors","abstract":[{"text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helps without personal data.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore/isDurable":{"defaultImplementations":1,"required":true,"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore\/isdurable","title":"isDurable","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDurable"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Whether records survive the app quitting. Receiving credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs a durable store unless the configuration is for development:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it also keeps an authorization in progress while the holder is at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. The default is false.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/message":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","title":"message","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/message","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"message","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Detail for logs: at most 300 characters, with no personal data, no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remote party’s own description, and no URL’s path or query.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCreden